---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Stardew Tips and our mission to help Stardew Valley players."
>
	<div class="simple-page container">
		<h1>About Stardew Tips</h1>
		<p>
			Stardew Tips is a fan-made resource for Stardew Valley players. Our goal is
			to provide clear, accurate, and up-to-date guides so you can spend less time
			frustrated and more time enjoying your farm.
		</p>
		<h2>What we cover</h2>
		<p>
			From seasonal crop planning and fishing to relationships, mining, and
			festivals, we write step-by-step guides that are easy to follow whether
			you're on your first playthrough or your tenth.
		</p>
		<h2>Disclaimer</h2>
		<p>
			Stardew Tips is an unofficial fan site. Stardew Valley is developed by
			ConcernedApe and published by ConcernedApe. We are not affiliated with,
			endorsed by, or sponsored by ConcernedApe. All game names, images, and
			trademarks belong to their respective owners.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
